    "title": "About the Plasma Storm set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Plasma Storm is a Black & White expansion released on 6 February 2013. It has 138 cards: 135 in the main set and 3 secret rares. There are also 119 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 135 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (254 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 257 cards, adding the 3 secret rares).",
